meta {
  name: 3 Mark one read
  type: http
  seq: 3
}
post {
  url: {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
  body: none
}
docs {
  `204 No Content`, no body. Owner-only: `403` for anyone but the recipient, which is also the answer
  for an id that does not exist — so this cannot be used to probe which ids are real.

  Idempotent. `is_read: false` is part of the write's filter, so marking an already-read notification
  writes nothing rather than replacing the document.

  Set `notificationId` from a `1 List notifications` response first.
}
